      "text": "Austin L. did a terrific job with our plumbing. We had our kitchen remodeled and he fixed the leaking problem another plumber had botched. We paid $959.00 for the plumbing and it probably wouldn’t have cost that much if Austin had been there to do the work but Action Plumbing sent over another Plumber named Ken B that hooked everything back up and left us with we had a pretty significant leak under our sink. Ken came back the next day and said the leak was coming from our disposal and we needed to replace it, so Ken put in a new disposal, but after he left and told us everything was working fine, we had that same significant leak going on. I was really upset because our disposal was not that old, so we paid for a disposal we did not need. When I called Action again about the leak, I asked them to send over a different plumber and that’s when Austin L showed up to save the day! He fixed the leak immediately and also straightened out the dishwasher that Ken had put in crooked. We are very pleased with Austin’s work! Thank you so much for your work. 😊",
